  "description_short": "French-inspired café serving artisan coffee, fresh pastries, and light meals in the heart of Plett's Main Beach.",
  "description_long": "Tucked away on Hopwood Street near Main Beach, La cafétéria plett brings a touch of French café culture to Plettenberg Bay. The relaxed atmosphere makes it an ideal spot for morning coffee and croissants, leisurely brunches, or a light lunch between beach sessions.\n\nThe menu focuses on quality café fare with European influences — think fresh pastries, well-crafted sandwiches, and proper espresso drinks. It's the kind of place where locals pop in for their daily coffee fix and visitors discover a welcoming break from the bustle of Central Beach. The location puts you within easy walking distance of Plett's main swimming beach and the town's shops and galleries.\n\nWhether you're after a quick bite before hitting the beach or a proper sit-down breakfast, this café delivers honest food without pretension. The laid-back service and consistent quality have earned it a loyal following among both residents and return visitors to the Garden Route.",
